      "id": "claim_da530a8fdc69452c849844bfaab1d38c",
      "statement": "Telemetry is off by default and the off state is structural (init never runs, start_trace finds no globals); when on, the hot path never blocks because record is a try_send and a full channel increments a drop counter, so under saturation celld sheds telemetry, counted, never requests.",
