    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7ffeb93252e9444cb5a924443aa24f76",
      "statement": "The telemetry schema is version v0-unstable and stamped on every object's metadata; there are two sinks — bucket writes Parquet under the telemetry/ prefix of the fleet bucket (requiring CELLD_BUCKET), and otlp sends the same data to an OpenTelemetry collector over OTLP/HTTP.",
