      "statement": "celld records a span for each stateless Worker request, each cell event (fetch, alarm, RPC, WebSocket message), each outbound fetch, and each cell start; console.log lines are recorded as log records carrying the trace and span id of the handler; the W3C traceparent header is read on incoming and sent on outbound requests; and celld records no metrics yet.",
