      "id": "claim_a19fbd2355e54841b47a8194f5d87f83",
      "statement": "The Parquet files are partitioned by node and by hour (telemetry/traces/<node>/<yyyy>/<mm>/<dd>/<hh>/<id>.parquet), so a query that reads one day touches only that day's files.",
