    {
      "id": "claim_bedbd3de04c9469e8bd1ae391b4d5214",
      "statement": "celld does not compact its own telemetry files because the serving path must not do storage maintenance; a compaction job on a maintenance node rewrites one past hour of small files into one large zstd-compressed file and then deletes the sources, while CELLD_OTEL_RETENTION controls celld's own deletion sweep.",
